le_name": "Screenshot_1.png", "id": "845251291614154", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_845251298280820_8365425217742155002_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n87eO44c0tQQ7kNvwHFxdO9&_nc_oc=AdraMUP0IuX9kmnqYoc71TUXo43s6jDIMPpCeiYv9flaR_EQOqTlJEtrucDEGJ4BjnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSFuVgB11ZMF75nYY5KM5KrZONyQM6SUcjwmdrmZo04Qw&oe=6B0DC0F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Farming Simulator Tractor World X", "keywords": ["FarmingSimulatorVR", "TractorSimulatorVR", "TractorWorldXVR", "FarmDrivingSimulator", "RealisticTractorGame"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf3e Welcome to Farming Simulator Tractor World X! \ud83c\udf3e\nExperience the ultimate farming adventure! Drive powerful tractors, plant and harvest crops, manage your farm, and explore vast fields in stunning 3D. From plowing to sowing, from harvesting to selling your produce, become the master of your own farm world.\nKey Features:\n\ud83d\ude9c Realistic Tractor Driving: Experience authentic tractor controls and mechanics.\n\ud83c\udf31 Farm Management: Grow a variety of crops, manage resources, and expand your farm.\n\ud83c\udf0d Explore Vast Fields: Open-world farming experience with diverse landscapes.\n\ud83c\udfaf Challenges & Missions: Complete tasks, earn rewards, and upgrade your equipment.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements & Leaderboards: Compete with friends and become the top farmer.\nWhether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore farming enthusiast, Farming Simulator Tractor World X brings the joy of real-life farming to your fingertips. Start your farming adventure now and build your dream farm!", "short_description": "Drive powerful tractors, grow crops, and explore the ultimate farming world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/farmingsimulatortractorworldx/home", "developer_terms_of