ops, manage your farm, and explore vast fields in stunning 3D. From plowing to sowing, from harvesting to selling your produce, become the master of your own farm world.\nKey Features:\n\ud83d\ude9c Realistic Tractor Driving: Experience authentic tractor controls and mechanics.\n\ud83c\udf31 Farm Management: Grow a variety of crops, manage resources, and expand your farm.\n\ud83c\udf0d Explore Vast Fields: Open-world farming experience with diverse landscapes.\n\ud83c\udfaf Challenges & Missions: Complete tasks, earn rewards, and upgrade your equipment.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements & Leaderboards: Compete with friends and become the top farmer.\nWhether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore farming enthusiast, Farming Simulator Tractor World X brings the joy of real-life farming to your fingertips. Start your farming adventure now and build your dream farm!", "short_description": "Drive powerful tractors, grow crops, and explore the ultimate farming world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/farmingsimulatortractorworldx/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VCode Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vcode-studio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25591136610523184"}}]}, 